Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Initially, all five nodes are separate, so every edge crosses a cluster boundary.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:05.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}初始时五个节点各自成簇，因此每条边都跨越簇边界。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.89,0:00:10.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}The six edge weights add to eighteen, which is our initial cutsize.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.89,0:00:10.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}六条边的权重之和为十八，这就是初始割边权重总和。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:15.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Nodes A and B, and nodes D and E, each have affinity five.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.55,0:00:15.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}A 与 B、D 与 E 的亲和度都是五。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:20.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Our tie-break first merges nodes A and B, with combined size two.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.39,0:00:20.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}按照平局规则，先合并 A 与 B，合并后的大小为二。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:25.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,628)}Their edge becomes internal, reducing cutsize from eighteen to thirteen.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.32,0:00:25.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(640,677)}它们之间的边变为簇内边，使割边权重总和从十八降到十三。
